    "Native silhouette outlines and original glow/pulse selection parameters (current overlay is bounds only).",
    "Full native gizmo geometry/draw/axis picking and remaining 16 legacy render modes.",
    "Generic selected camera/model/asset preview view/output binding and isolation; fixed M8 woodbox preview is a regression control.",
